    narr:narration """The narrative trajectory for [decision capture](narr:Position_CoreFeatureDecisionCapture) has shifted from a foundational product thesis established in March 2026 to empirical validation by August 2026. The core argument—that capturing artifacts at the moment of consensus is the platform's primary value unlock—was tested against [Sprint 4 delivery evidence](narr:Position_Sprint4DeliveryEvidence). This validation phase centers on the [successful shipment of the async decision widget](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1786011453597_1) and a [record-breaking velocity of 23 points](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1786011453597_2). These outcomes are explicitly linked to the [Zephyr integration](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1786011453597_3), which is now positioned not merely as a feature, but as the essential mechanism for realizing the product's value proposition. The current state of the graph reflects a transition from conceptual definition to a demonstration of technical and team-level output.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1786011453597_1> ;
